# {{.project_name}}

A governed ML/AI product on the Azure AI Platform. It is deployed through the
platform's promotion chain — **DEV → STG → PROD**, same source and same commit
SHA in every environment — and production deployment stays behind the Azure
DevOps Environment approval.

The contract this product is held to is
[`docs/platform/product-contract.md`](../../docs/platform/product-contract.md).
Read it before changing ownership boundaries, adding infrastructure, or altering
how environment values reach the code.

